event: response.output_text.done
data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","content_index":0,"item_id":"msg_0138491d953d0f3d0069e16f8a1fac819783312978d48c6606","logprobs":[],"output_index":0,"sequence_number":403,"text":"At dawn, golden sunlight filtered through the tangled branches of the ancient forest. A young fox named Lira padded quietly over dew-soft moss, her russet fur glowing like fire against a sea of emerald ferns. She paused, delicate ears swiveling to catch the distant trill of a songbird and the lazy gurgle of a stream winding through the glade ahead.\n\nAs Lira ventured deeper, the air grew cooler, heavy with the scent of damp earth and wild mint. Ferns brushed against her sides and shadows flickered as she slipped beneath arching roots and sprawling brambles. The trunks of towering oaks loomed above, their bark tattooed with lichen and moss. Lira stopped to nose at a cluster of mushrooms, delicate white domes hidden in shadow. Her swift eyes darted to a blue butterfly resting on a leaf, its wings quivering as if whispering secrets.\n\nHer paws led her to a clearing where sunlight spilled in warm pools, dappling the ground in gold. Here, a family of rabbits scattered at her arrival, their white tails flickering like specters. Lira crouched low, but curiosity steered her more than hunger today. She watched in awe as a red squirrel leapt from branch to branch above, chittering bravely.\n\nThe farther she went, the denser the forest grew. Wild honeysuckle hung in sweet-scented tangles, and tangled vines formed mysterious green tunnels. Lira squeezed through, emerging near the burbling stream she’d heard. She dipped her nose to the water, the chill stinging her whiskers, and admired her shimmering reflection amidst darting minnows.\n\nAs twilight painted lavender shadows, fireflies flickered on, dotting the darkness with living stars. Lira lay beneath the roots of an old beech, heart thrumming with the secrets of the forest. In the soft hush, she sensed she belonged; a bright spirit woven through the wild, beautiful world."}

